<title>UK: London shipsales.</title>
<headline>London shipsales.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-11-20</dateline>
<text>
<p>Secondhand tonnage brokers reported the sale of the following vessels.</p>
<p>BULKERS - Catherine Venture - (built 1981) 132,016 dwt sold to Greek buyers for $10.3 million.</p>
<p>Ios - (built 1985) 62,598 dwt sold to Greek buyers for $12.7 million.</p>
<p>SOLD FOR DEMOLITION - Long Challenger - 164,338 dwt sold to Bangladeshi breakers for $173 per ldt.</p>
<p>Some of these sales may not be final as they may be subject to inspection,  survey or other conditions.</p>
</text>
